lines:
辛苦了！这里是宝可
梦中心。{be01}
在这里可以回复宝可
梦的体力。{be01}
要让您的宝可梦休息
一下吗？

Your Pokémon may be infected with
Pokérus.{be01}
Little is known about the Pokérus
except that they are microscopic life-{be00}
forms that attach to Pokémon.{be01}
While infected, Pokémon are said to
grow exceptionally well.

Oh, hello.
You are?{be01}
Okay, your name’s {0100:0}.
I can see that you’re a Trainer.{be01}
So that means you use the Pokémon
Storage System I developed.{be01}
How I arrived at that conclusion is
a simple deductive process.{be01}
You spoke to me because you wanted
to access something on this PC.{be01}
Oh, I’m sorry. I’m Lanette.{be01}
Honestly, I’m glad to meet you - it’s
great you’re using the Storage System.{be01}
If you could, please visit me at home.
My house is on Route 114.
